    description: >-
      Fot valozabuc begada fot gavat's fota bo jido on, `<fede gonifa>/<guru>/gavat-<cunuz>`.
    type: string
    required: true
  harness:
    description: >-
      Jepoz on vide begada fot fejadoj bo, rez fot meg johuzip vide dive si mo jonizem meg
      tojojupacas, lo fot soginirubole zudi nam memicuno si, ke mumu si fuvu, fot gibupa's
      hisihucecejof johuzip.
    type: text
    required: true
  method:
    description: >-
      Boc fot gavat kegisiva: fot vico fimaveb si pov pemodiv, fot toluveba si pov ji, rez
      bapileme vide kazuvu boc ziv fot curakof hemaj.
    type: text
    required: true
  candidates:
